 "sentences": [
  {
   "text": "Grandpa left me three things.",
   "nefes": 0.2,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "A crane.",
   "nefes": 0.2,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "A debt.",
   "nefes": 0.2,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "And a list, with one line I'm not allowed to read.",
   "nefes": 0.4,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Ten buildings to take down.",
   "nefes": 0.1,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Nine, in old black ink.",
   "nefes": 0.1,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "The tenth is scratched out.",
   "nefes": 0.2,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "In blue.",
   "nefes": 0.3,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "And the blue is fresh.",
   "nefes": 0.8,
   "mark": "ink",
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "The crane is called Daisy.",
   "nefes": 0.1,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "She is older than my dad, and she hates mornings.",
   "nefes": 0.3,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Job one: an old chimney, in an empty lot.",
   "nefes": 0.2,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "The night before, I flattened forty towers in Demolition Master.",
   "nefes": 0,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "In the game, you just try again.",
   "nefes": 0.2,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Real chimneys don't.",
   "nefes": 0.8,
   "mark": "real",
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "I pulled the lever.",
   "nefes": 0.1,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Daisy beeped.",
   "nefes": 1.05,
   "mark": "beep",
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Twice.",
   "nefes": 0.35,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "I ignored her.",
   "nefes": 0.2,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "The chimney fell the wrong way.",
   "nefes": 0.5,
   "mark": "fall",
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Nobody was near.",
   "nefes": 0.2,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "My professor says, that's called luck.",
   "nefes": 0.5,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "In the bricks, I found a stamp.",
   "nefes": 0.1,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Two letters.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "H, and K.",
   "nefes": 0.6,
   "mark": "stamp",
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "And I keep thinking about that beep.",
   "nefes": 0.1,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Daisy beeped twice before it fell.",
   "nefes": 0.3,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Like she knew.",
